<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: #111">
    <p>Hello {{fullName}},</p>
    <p>
      <strong>{{organizationName}}</strong> has been approved on <strong>{{appName}}</strong>.
      Your account was added as {{#if isLegalRep}}its <strong>legal representative</strong>{{else}}an <strong>owner</strong>{{/if}}.
    </p>
    <p>
      Sign in as usual — nothing about your password changes — and open the organization:
      <a href="{{manageUrl}}" style="color: #0b57d0">{{organizationName}}</a>.
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: #444">{{manageUrl}}</p>
    <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: #666">
      We will never send you a password link for this. If an email asks you to reset your
      password because of an organization role, it is not from us.
    </p>
  </body>
</html>
